              "content": "Lists threads visible to the caller, ordered by most recent activity first (`updatedAt` when present, otherwise `createdAt`). Personal keys see their own threads plus every org-published thread; the org-wide principal (shared by org-wide API keys and M2M applications) sees every org-published thread.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
